# FS-CCE-387 omission DisclosurePrivacyScope
:expect-pins 2

# Missing DisclosurePrivacyScope withholds every disclosure consequence, including alternate action.
? obliged(OblSpecialOmit387DisclosurePrivacyScopeDisclosureBearer, OblSpecialOmit387DisclosurePrivacyScopeDisclosureDuty, OblSpecialOmit387DisclosurePrivacyScopeDisclosureStandard).
# => FALSE

# Missing DisclosurePrivacyScope withholds every disclosure consequence, including alternate action.
? obliged(OblSpecialOmit387DisclosurePrivacyScopeDisclosureReader, ReadAndActOnProportionateDisclosure, OblSpecialOmit387DisclosurePrivacyScopeDisclosureStandard).
# => FALSE
